                  <decoDesc>
                     <decoNote type="border"> Illustrated borders are found on <locus>ff. 1v, 15r,
                           29v, 37r, 49r, 59r, 70r, 81v, 97v, 112r, and 127r</locus>. These borders
                        were torn out, partially mutilating the illuminated folios, and were later
                        restored to the codex; another, less careful hand supplied the portion of
                        text that had been removed, possibly from Cambridge University Library Ms. Add. 8275. </decoNote>
                     <decoNote type="decInit">Good initials (some cut out and restored). (<ref
                           target="https://catalog.hathitrust.org/Record/000468709">Pächt and
                           Alexander</ref> i. 887, pl. LXVI) </decoNote>
                  </decoDesc>

